# The program lays a URL under box.v through a receiver nobody knows, behind a Map of the same family of sites that has left already. What the formatter is told may not hang on whether a pass of Link ran on one thread or on the lanes, which begin at a number of steps: a large program died where a small one printed.
# `testaot run` itself asks Link in the order of the worklist and scattered, which runs every pass on the lanes, and fails where the tables differ.
# RUN: link lookups mechanisms=all
# CHECK: lookup name-written-through-unseen-by-program "v"
# RUN(LANES): link lookups scattered mechanisms=all
# LANES: lookup name-written-through-unseen-by-program "v"
# RUN(FEATURES): features
